      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحامسوا</span></b>  <i>They vied with, strove to surpass,</i>
or <i>contended for superiority with, one another in
strength,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَادّوا</span>,) <i>and fought one another.</i> (TA.)

